## GoPro Status
- 636 employees (down from 1,552 in 2016)
- Revenue: $652M (2025), down from $1.16B (2021)
- R&D: $127M (2025), cut 32% from $186M
- Market cap: $137M — less than a Series B
- ~190-250 engineers estimated (30-40% of headcount)
- HyperSmooth patents dismissed by ITC in Insta360 case

## Meta Brand Advertising Leadership Research
- Key people with brand/agency backgrounds: Nicola Mendelsohn (BBH/Grey/Karmarama), Andrea Gellert (AmEx/OnDeck/Clover), Nicole Pinochet (BBDO/Ogilvy, now departed), Karin Tracy (head of luxury/fashion/auto industry)
